Z||000014||cadaver||06-18-2001||01:58 AM||||No the master cylinder wont get funky. Each piston is moving less. But if you start screwing with different calipers and such you will need a proportioning valve.||||reg||1
Z||000015||cadaver||06-18-2001||02:01 AM||||It doesnt say 4 piston calipers. It says big piston calipers. So you will need a bigger master. As you could run out of travel on the stock one before you get enough pressure built up.||||reg||1
